{"version":1,"content":"<p>伍詠薇（伍姑娘）與李彩華（Rain）在HOY訪談節目《九運會客室2》中，分享入行多年遇過的不愉快經歷。</p><p>伍姑娘憶述，昔日出席卡拉OK聚會時，曾遭一名男子強行拉入廁所，險被侵犯；</p><p>李彩華則透露，早年曾被公司同事問及是否願意陪人去旅行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:42:07.145380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:10:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:18:03.644798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:39.445308+00:00","content_hash":"3dec5bbcfafb8cbe94b2d1ac98a6acc7c5147cb7b0f5bba02ca65b0cf384ab83","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}